  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/F4xh4pWQ/2025-03-30-22-43-02-kopia1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>不死軍團解放</strong>是一款旨在擴展不死生物及其他相關生物的模組，為 Minecraft 增添更黑暗的氛圍，同時盡可能保留原版風格，或至少嘗試這麼做...</p><p>&nbsp;目前支援的 MC 版本：<strong>1.20.1</strong></p><p><strong>需求：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></p><p><strong>相容於：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>內容概述與技術資訊請見&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fundead-unleashed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>！</strong></h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9kMGkRHe/images/62fbd0f4d89160fbf933d9ca507bcca780b613e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1516\" height=\"853\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9kMGkRHe/images/cd9b46aaba83e62865102dac60d195f5e0466cce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1658\" height=\"933\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9kMGkRHe/images/ffdd05d5993b6d3aed3ef0c6ec73f0e25cac77ce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"778\" height=\"437\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aebd2336e0d643bc201d7cae6e209a5c667f75d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>",
